    "en": {
      "trackName": "Falling Blocks - Puzzle Game",
      "description": "Falling Blocks is a very addictive game that helps you exercise your brain and improve you logic skills.\n\nHow to play\n- Swipe left and right to move the blocks\n- Tap to rotate the blocks \n- Swipe down to slam the blocks into place or wait for them to slowly fall into place\n- Form a line horizontally to clear out the blocks\n- There is no need to worry about matching colours\n- Try and beat your high score and challenge your friends on Game Center\n- Try to earn all the achievements on Game Center\n- Chose between dark and light theme\n- Collect stars and use them to unlock theme packs such as emoji and tennis\n- If you have an Apple Watch all your settings and themes will automatically sync to the watch\n\nMultiple Difficulties available\n- Easy: 10x15 grid with mostly original shapes\n- Medium: 12x18 grid with more complex shapes\n- Hard: 14x21 grid with more complex shapes than medium",
      "releaseNotes": "- Minor bug fixes\n\nVersion 2.0\n- New and improved design\n- Game center achievements\n- Multiple difficulties including easy, medium and hard\n- Auto-Save and resume game\n- More themes\n- Touch control options\n- Option to enable and disable grid lines\n- Option to enable or disable ghost piece\n- Sync themes and settings from phone to watch app\n- Bug fixes and improvements",
